Error [E1102]: `session` can't cross into a task because `Browser` isn't sendable
  --> native_bidi_session_handles_cannot_cross_tasks_or_channels.jet:9:28
    |
  9 |     handle :: task session.close()
    |                            ^^^^^
 Why: `Browser` owns thread-local state and must stay on the thread that created it; tasks and channels move owned values between threads
 Fix: Give the task plain owned data, or rebuild the value as an owned copy before spawning
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E1102

Error [E1102]: `session` can't be sent because `Browser` isn't sendable
  --> native_bidi_session_handles_cannot_cross_tasks_or_channels.jet:11:17
    |
 11 |     sender.send(session)
    |                 ^^^^^^^
 Why: `Browser` owns thread-local state and must stay on the thread that created it; tasks and channels move owned values between threads
 Fix: Send plain owned data instead, or rebuild the value as an owned copy before calling `.send()`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E1102

Error [L1101]: `handle` still owes `join`
  --> native_bidi_session_handles_cannot_cross_tasks_or_channels.jet:9:5
    |
  9 |     handle :: task session.close()
    |     ^^^^^^
 Why: The program may end before this task finishes
 Fix: Join it with `.join()`, use its result, or write `.detach()` to let it go free
More: jet-lang.dev/e/L1101
